@startuml
title OmniDesk AI Synchronization Workflow

start

:Receive synchronization trigger;
:Load active provider connections;
:Request communication data from provider;

if (Provider response valid?) then (yes)
  :Validate external data;
  :Map data to internal communication model;
  :Check provider and message identifiers;

  if (Duplicate record?) then (yes)
    :Skip duplicate record;
  else (no)
    :Store normalized communication data;
  endif

  :Record successful synchronization;
  :Update provider synchronization status;
else (no)
  :Classify integration or synchronization failure;
  :Preserve previously synchronized data;
  :Record safe diagnostic event;
  :Report failure status to the user;
endif

stop
@enduml